@startuml
title L2-052 - Apply the authoritative visual system consistently
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Owner / release reviewer" as actor
box "Frontend - Independent design-system site" #E0F2FE
participant "TokenReferencePage / visual review" as page
participant "ComponentStateGallery" as entity
participant "Bundled token catalog / examples" as client
end box
note over page, client : Static local content; no Loupe backend participates
actor -> page : Start workflow / review
page -> entity : Compare application controls with approved examples [L2-052]
entity -> client : Render eight screen baselines at 375/768/1440
client --> entity : Token-based states and untinted full-frame imagery
entity --> page : Recorded match or reviewed deliberate baseline change
page --> actor : observable visual consistency; source compliance by review
@enduml
